cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RED-PAN-Motion: multi-task earthquake detection, phase picking and first-motion polarity for 90-second seismic windows"
abstract: >-
  A pure-PyTorch multi-task MTAN R2U-Net that jointly performs earthquake
  detection, P and S phase picking, and first-motion polarity on 90-second
  three-component seismic windows at 100 Hz. Ships three pretrained
  checkpoints: the RED-PAN 60 s release of 2024-01-07 (REDPAN_60s_240107), ported
  to PyTorch, the 90 s RP90-Motion model, and EdgeRP90 for edge deployment.
